sequenceDiagram
    participant BR as Event Broker
    participant NS as Notification Service
    participant PR as Providers
    participant UI as Player UI (WS)
    participant SCH as Scheduler

    SCH->>NS: Schedule reminders (cron/delay)
    BR->>NS: application.decided / match.started / match.finished
    NS->>NS: Select template & channel
    NS->>PR: Send via provider
    PR-->>NS: Delivery status
    NS-->>UI: WebSocket push (if connected)


